    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d129">

                <pb facs="0213" n="97" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg97"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/427.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Extract.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1911-05-18">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 18, 1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The French are reported to be holding back advances for Manchuria because of
                    Russian pressure.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Calhoun</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
